					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ionnina&lt;/color&gt;, a countess of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Dominion&lt;/color&gt;, is making a request. A mechanoid swarm has been attacking her settlements. She wants you to signal the mechs to distract them while she clears the hive. If you do, (*Threat)a mechanoid cluster(/Threat) will land at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt;.

The pods contain these dangers:

  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 tesseron&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 count-down activator&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 mech node&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 auto charge turret&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 mini-slugger turrets&lt;/color&gt;

The mechanoid cluster will be initially dormant. It may have a countdown activator, or it may stay dormant forever until disturbed.</description>
