						<name>Bloody Cult</name>
						<adjective>Gua'daabreiic</adjective>
						<memberName>Gua'daabreiite</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>First Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>First Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>In an old universe of strife, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Gua'daabrei&lt;/color&gt; whipped up great fire that swept away the last age, and brought forth a new one. The God of Creation &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Gua'daabrei&lt;/color&gt; ate the bodies of his enemies. Across the vast stellar distances, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Gua'daabrei&lt;/color&gt;'s will sustained the life of mankind against the void.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>In an old universe of strife, %%deity0_name%% whipped up great fire that swept away the last age, and brought forth a new one. The %%deity0_type%% %%deity0_name%% ate the bodies of %%deity0_possessive%% enemies. Across the vast stellar distances, %%deity0_name%%'s will sustained the life of mankind against the void.</descriptionTemplate>
